    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Given the flop, turn or river, When a bet and three raises have been made, Then the only legal actions for the remaining players are call and fold [REQ-016.3]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Given a heads-up $4/$8 hand where the button posted the $2 small blind and the other player the $4 big blind, When the button raises to $8, the big blind re-raises to $12 and the button raises to $16, Then the big blind's only legal actions are call $4 and fold; Given a heads-up flop where a bet and three raises have been made, Then the only legal actions are call and fold [REQ-016.4]",
      "checked": false
    },
